  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:43.170" end="00:49.150" ttm:agent="v1">I'm out</p>
      <p begin="00:49.150" end="00:53.120" ttm:agent="v1">Nothing here to care about</p>
      <p begin="00:53.120" end="01:01.120" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:01.320" end="01:07.620" ttm:agent="v1">What's that sound?</p>
      <p begin="01:07.620" end="01:13.680" ttm:agent="v1">What's that song about?</p>
      <p begin="01:13.680" end="01:17.810" ttm:agent="v1">It's nothing worth me sayin' aloud</p>
      <p begin="01:17.810" end="01:23.190" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:23.190" end="01:31.190" ttm:agent="v1">So then why do I seem to</p>
      <p begin="01:34.100" end="01:38.530" ttm:agent="v1">Need to?</p>
      <p begin="01:38.530" end="01:46.530" ttm:agent="v1">Then why do I seem to</p>
      <p begin="01:46.860" end="01:49.360" ttm:agent="v1">Need to?</p>
